{"files": [{"id": 47099641, "name": "ppat.1011970.s002.eps", "size": 1902742, "is_link_only": false, "download_url": "https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/47099641", "supplied_md5": "b29146c39af1d74b63342a2e24f9ee70", "computed_md5": "b29146c39af1d74b63342a2e24f9ee70", "mimetype": "image/x-eps"}], "folder_structure": {}, "authors": [{"id": 4308, "full_name": "Yan Chen", "first_name": "Yan", "last_name": "Chen", "is_active": false, "url_name": "Yan_Chen", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 18841048, "full_name": "Rodney P. Kincaid", "first_name": "Rodney P.", "last_name": "Kincaid", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 18841051, "full_name": "Kelley Bastin", "first_name": "Kelley", "last_name": "Bastin", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 18841054, "full_name": "Devin N. Fachko", "first_name": "Devin N.", "last_name": "Fachko", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 18841057, "full_name": "Rebecca L. Skalsky", "first_name": "Rebecca L.", "last_name": "Skalsky", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}], "custom_fields": [], "figshare_url": "https://plos.figshare.com/articles/figure/S2_Fig_-/26051908", "download_disabled": false, "description": "<p>A. Ingenuity pathway analysis of miR-142 targets. A total of 183 genes identified in PAR-CLIP datasets from <a href=\"http://www.plospathogens.org/article/info:doi/10.1371/journal.ppat.1011970#ppat.1011970.g003\" target=\"_blank\">Fig 3</a> were queried using IPA core analysis (QIAGEN). Enriched canonical pathways were defined, and individual pathways selected for visual representation. B and C. Overlap of miR-142 targets identified in this study (BL PAR-CLIP) compared to miR-142 targets identified in published BC1 and BC3 PAR-CLIP (PMCID: PMC3222872) or BL and PEL HITS-CLIP studies (PMCID: PMC3343464 and PMC3426530).</p> <p>(EPS)</p>", "funding": null, "funding_list": [], "version": 1, "status": "public", "size": 1902742, "created_date": "2024-06-17